OL,3,ATwo killed in attack on airport in
OL,4,Aeastern Saudi Arabia, authorities say
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people were killed and eight others
OL,7,Finjured in an attack on an airport in
OL,8,FDammam, eastern Saudi Arabia on
OL,9,FWednesday evening, the kingdom's
OL,10,FGeneral Authority of Civil Aviation
OL,11,F(GACA) says.
OL,13,FThose killed at King Fahd International
OL,14,FAirport were a Saudi citizen and an
OL,15,FIndian resident, while the injured were
OL,16,FSaudi, Indian, Yemeni, Bangladeshi and
OL,17,FNepalese nationals.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
